&ANALYZE-SUSPEND _UIB-CODE-BLOCK _PROCEDURE linkTocad-balan DBOProgram 
PROCEDURE linkTocad-balan :
/*------------------------------------------------------------------------------
  Purpose:     
  Parameters:  <none>
  Notes:       
------------------------------------------------------------------------------*/
DEFINE INPUT PARAMETER pHandle AS HANDLE NO-UNDO.

RUN getKey IN pHandle (OUTPUT c-cod-balan-aux).

RETURN "OK":U.

END PROCEDURE.

