&ANALYZE-SUSPEND _UIB-CODE-BLOCK _PROCEDURE OpenQueryCodBalan DBOProgram 
PROCEDURE OpenQueryCodBalan :
/*------------------------------------------------------------------------------
  Purpose:     
  Parameters:  <none>
  Notes:       
------------------------------------------------------------------------------*/
OPEN QUERY qr{&TableName} FOR EACH {&tablename} NO-LOCK 
                             WHERE {&tablename}.cod-balanca = c-cod-balan-aux INDEXED-REPOSITION.

RETURN "OK":U.

END PROCEDURE.

